{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-5361237852816220459"},"published":{"$t":"2014-01-18T18:54:00.000+01:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2014-01-19T17:57:06.789+01:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nitra v 9. storočí - kresba"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Nitra v 9. storočí"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNáš spolupracovník Tomáš Humaj pre nás nakreslil predstavu predpokladaného vzhľadu <a href=\"http://www.hradiska.sk/search/label/Nitra\" target=\"_blank\">hradiska v Nitre</a> na hradnom kopci, kde s najväčšou pravdepodobnosťou stálo v 9. storočí centrálne hradisko Nitrianskeho kniežatstva. Kresba zachytáva iba opevnenie samotného hradného kopca a nezahŕňa predpokladané opevnenie podhradia, ani okolité hradiská.&nbsp;</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUBNKKGkwYYnAWsgsH88oyO3WmGcvZh4-MlICWU2Q_vw3i2ZET98ZEvgflxRMRyEjJddBnIM6F68y8vvfSl9v54IuLr_hZ8m_v7QQnjJETT3ssD5CZfKORByJljuHa7fgX7qewLE9muMk/s1600/P1183895.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUBNKKGkwYYnAWsgsH88oyO3WmGcvZh4-MlICWU2Q_vw3i2ZET98ZEvgflxRMRyEjJddBnIM6F68y8vvfSl9v54IuLr_hZ8m_v7QQnjJETT3ssD5CZfKORByJljuHa7fgX7qewLE9muMk/s1600/P1183895.JPG\" height=\"227\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjWibsYBJB6HrTKN2WhezXAODH7s_E_B3nbroqmb2liCYVlXo883PDSXIjoeycxgvS0U0ibtGLLdlaRCsZ9_VYXKI50sUgWPG51HXucCVuIz4v2oW9-6l7hiPbqvm4J0PkN4nn7madZQJg/s1600/P1183896.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjWibsYBJB6HrTKN2WhezXAODH7s_E_B3nbroqmb2liCYVlXo883PDSXIjoeycxgvS0U0ibtGLLdlaRCsZ9_VYXKI50sUgWPG51HXucCVuIz4v2oW9-6l7hiPbqvm4J0PkN4nn7madZQJg/s1600/P1183896.JPG\" height=\"227\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhPGcLlKPSFWm0qxbmxpdbmpG_N_H5UeYfnHLHLlXuvNpt1Toda6D54bw_7PS7vUzoiuGtQ18KMvDD6PRSyL5BGaw_rqTS-j_mBOQq7dRf2OtS1755Afq_LwYzHBR6RaALFotsfGNG8Guk/s1600/P1183898.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhPGcLlKPSFWm0qxbmxpdbmpG_N_H5UeYfnHLHLlXuvNpt1Toda6D54bw_7PS7vUzoiuGtQ18KMvDD6PRSyL5BGaw_rqTS-j_mBOQq7dRf2OtS1755Afq_LwYzHBR6RaALFotsfGNG8Guk/s1600/P1183898.JPG\" height=\"240\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2GwOw-u7cFti9nzxxI7SeL5Pmws4m1AIpumsl-bb-T374ECMKhdC2TGld3Q2SRcLunXxM860WpoYLy0SQhfjx_hbXOQEjj9RR9-vZxxsTXAYvtJQofwalmOwgiKgYpAFZt0Ou0Sej5cI/s1600/P1183900.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2GwOw-u7cFti9nzxxI7SeL5Pmws4m1AIpumsl-bb-T374ECMKhdC2TGld3Q2SRcLunXxM860WpoYLy0SQhfjx_hbXOQEjj9RR9-vZxxsTXAYvtJQofwalmOwgiKgYpAFZt0Ou0Sej5cI/s1600/P1183900.JPG\" height=\"240\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nPri kreslení sme vychádzali z doposiaľ známych pôdorysov od archeológov, ktoré zachytávajú predpokladaný priebeh opevnenia hradného kopca, z rekonštrukcií preskúmaných častí veľkomoravského valu, ktorého zvyšky sa na niektorých miestach dochovali (kamenná čelná plenta), z leteckých záberov na hradný kopec a zo zachovaných medirytín z neskoršieho stredoveku. Zachovali sme predpokladaný vstup na hradisko zo západnej časti hradného kopca a rešpektovali sme konfiguráciu terénu a súčasnú fortifikáciu na akropole hradu, pretože podľa nášho názoru je vzhľadom na terén vysoko pravdepodobné, že aj v období Nitrianskeho kniežatstva bola v týchto miestach vybudovaná hradba, ktorá oddeľovala najvyššiu časť hradiska (akropolu) od predhradia. Na akropole hradiska archeológovia predpokladajú kamennú palácovú stavbu a samozrejme aj murovaný kostol. Okrem toho možno predpokladať niekoľko ďalších reprezentatívnych stavieb v areáli akropoly, keďže tu zrejme žili najbližší rodinní príslušníci kniežaťa a možno aj iní významní hodnostári svetskej či cirkevnej moci. Preto stavby na akropole sú na tú dobu veľmi veľké a honosné. Do predhradia sme dali niekoľko menších zrubových domov, kde mohli žiť remeselníci, obchodníci a členovia družiny. Príliš veľkú zastavanosť predhradia sme nezvolili, pretože aj z najstarších zobrazení hradu sa javí, že tu nesálo príliš veľké množstvo &nbsp;stavieb - zrejme z obranných dôvodov.</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiRFPkDcIOM0C_n0LE-cj_mH7BnSSd3NLHegRu4l0SnTLASJK7XKIFLxth2A9afjI3nHPWFmouaxw5MAcqB3aAUjzBQd81RGlC8uarcbUW6BWA54_8_KWKMvmTH2K8Jn9KeLWl9J4obc-I/s1600/1477392_10152022733602347_558929816_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiRFPkDcIOM0C_n0LE-cj_mH7BnSSd3NLHegRu4l0SnTLASJK7XKIFLxth2A9afjI3nHPWFmouaxw5MAcqB3aAUjzBQd81RGlC8uarcbUW6BWA54_8_KWKMvmTH2K8Jn9KeLWl9J4obc-I/s1600/1477392_10152022733602347_558929816_n.jpg\" height=\"255\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjHRRMEMJplqVIpzIvVbLZ96DPuohToqByHEGHIZpDrvDknNZMAIm7slCFYlr1AQqK9TRpvWuCubotsCwGsQ0ggVzIxe4srQoWqQOO_Ry7zZFlcILAxkpwV_0CN6oEMIfWb4KVs7q6VAQU/s1600/pla%CC%81n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjHRRMEMJplqVIpzIvVbLZ96DPuohToqByHEGHIZpDrvDknNZMAIm7slCFYlr1AQqK9TRpvWuCubotsCwGsQ0ggVzIxe4srQoWqQOO_Ry7zZFlcILAxkpwV_0CN6oEMIfWb4KVs7q6VAQU/s1600/pla%CC%81n.jpg\" height=\"320\" width=\"241\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Pôdorys hradiska podľa Dr. Bednára</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEitv00qOanyS7ob5lsy6_d1xgwh3eQLbFFY8DpWOs46NpTOUjLbluIPWc4ahrIdmib_TWFNyajCSil-9PEPpSJSOQvzoZ6pQC-dOyzp1T0OgAz10FqvrSZ-441vV_kaLyRu_HK0V-78OB8/s1600/1461145_734344219912375_542841313_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEitv00qOanyS7ob5lsy6_d1xgwh3eQLbFFY8DpWOs46NpTOUjLbluIPWc4ahrIdmib_TWFNyajCSil-9PEPpSJSOQvzoZ6pQC-dOyzp1T0OgAz10FqvrSZ-441vV_kaLyRu_HK0V-78OB8/s1600/1461145_734344219912375_542841313_n.jpg\" height=\"227\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjzzcQC-AyiwWArdQnACNI52gGXd5C-YLGTKJHPE6oFg1ED-c1882XqfioaaZMPkGMqRayEykXhjEGKavHUtS7kNK1rxD0WZgcngcVUiqebLvL-eh9la2BJyQ_aFWj7qIO7Ye4d6KAoAe4/s1600/1458897_10152022622682347_1437922024_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjzzcQC-AyiwWArdQnACNI52gGXd5C-YLGTKJHPE6oFg1ED-c1882XqfioaaZMPkGMqRayEykXhjEGKavHUtS7kNK1rxD0WZgcngcVUiqebLvL-eh9la2BJyQ_aFWj7qIO7Ye4d6KAoAe4/s1600/1458897_10152022622682347_1437922024_n.jpg\" height=\"231\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiMyTczkyygg3u_cW-vfTXpx-aH5JZIUWUxNKfE2T81SHxMOEy8e8KzCXLlLJasAcqmbKKMif4mLP9A4fZLatdU4CkLqOk4yl1HD4UeEsQ98Pm6OvcytS8Lr0tWcyEny481JYgbZhi8ygw/s1600/1474934_10152022623652347_2125048002_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiMyTczkyygg3u_cW-vfTXpx-aH5JZIUWUxNKfE2T81SHxMOEy8e8KzCXLlLJasAcqmbKKMif4mLP9A4fZLatdU4CkLqOk4yl1HD4UeEsQ98Pm6OvcytS8Lr0tWcyEny481JYgbZhi8ygw/s1600/1474934_10152022623652347_2125048002_n.jpg\" height=\"320\" width=\"308\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_x1MSRuk_cQ-9M2KHZ4ek6WldvYaZCztgZIvNbw2Aa8myNdStPZaE7JRH852meosBEwaqwCfT3NkHoZBpLkXZZWD3DAT9Hmlljzi7PHcsGUdCIaQjw6tJTIY9LRWQCV1gDhYlBniTgeg/s1600/1484959_10152022623707347_151082291_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_x1MSRuk_cQ-9M2KHZ4ek6WldvYaZCztgZIvNbw2Aa8myNdStPZaE7JRH852meosBEwaqwCfT3NkHoZBpLkXZZWD3DAT9Hmlljzi7PHcsGUdCIaQjw6tJTIY9LRWQCV1gDhYlBniTgeg/s1600/1484959_10152022623707347_151082291_n.jpg\" height=\"178\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjSoDeLRbVgnKQj-oDL7lUCzUX0eF6_N_q4BVKyxQqcFy4KHJ4bZIcTXtm7lLhY7QBtiWZR9J3HmY5ZND2rIGADfWFR2MKPxcetZgfVdzFksdIMPL2EgS6MCl6eGEWK43F_mfOJUHKUkiE/s1600/mapa-02.jpeg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjSoDeLRbVgnKQj-oDL7lUCzUX0eF6_N_q4BVKyxQqcFy4KHJ4bZIcTXtm7lLhY7QBtiWZR9J3HmY5ZND2rIGADfWFR2MKPxcetZgfVdzFksdIMPL2EgS6MCl6eGEWK43F_mfOJUHKUkiE/s1600/mapa-02.jpeg\" height=\"240\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEin1m79xA0Ru5rkdfamXFe4HuCqfEgXSsTv120Absq9h4Wup16xDU1mp5GnlGVAetJ5m4ziv07EnaEeIIb5l7mrLir8DFDiCMsjBFBkU2eBJ6Z46ggoAIdIQQLL-Y_SUM09PXFclFFtDiw/s1600/rytina-nitra-02.jpeg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEin1m79xA0Ru5rkdfamXFe4HuCqfEgXSsTv120Absq9h4Wup16xDU1mp5GnlGVAetJ5m4ziv07EnaEeIIb5l7mrLir8DFDiCMsjBFBkU2eBJ6Z46ggoAIdIQQLL-Y_SUM09PXFclFFtDiw/s1600/rytina-nitra-02.jpeg\" height=\"240\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiuggBRK66WtSJTXOm1GDA2LG7TL1bUPYkdesntdzvXBoF3rP0kGOhMreSQSS268kOxaIkAInyupnRihWEbLJ6TEo_vpPLB4-CBMCXp_MFpcOGC4pRweKpLCXZJgfeoFZ0FtR8ZfqJs8n8/s1600/rytina-nitra-11.jpeg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiuggBRK66WtSJTXOm1GDA2LG7TL1bUPYkdesntdzvXBoF3rP0kGOhMreSQSS268kOxaIkAInyupnRihWEbLJ6TEo_vpPLB4-CBMCXp_MFpcOGC4pRweKpLCXZJgfeoFZ0FtR8ZfqJs8n8/s1600/rytina-nitra-11.jpeg\" height=\"240\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTreba upozorniť, že sa jedná zrejme vôbec o prvý pokus nakresliť nitrianske centrálne hradisko a ide o našu amatérsku kresbu. Ak sme urobili v niečom chyby, boli neúmyselné, ale radi prijmeme konštruktívnu kritiku. Možno na jej základe a na základe tohto nášho prvého výtvoru sa niekto ďalší pokúsi vytvoriť presnejšiu kresbu, ktorú tiež veľmi radi zverejníme.<br />\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCigkLfxCxt1tv2y0FkQh6OSXQPIIaxZxKZeNKYzs1B3MzCcMA5nwCOxhexjsUWpqdlA-KT3R5_jVsKFc9ChhX46pWDhJyfXq8XTbqNRTB0LGIqbgcniUozYCSHW_NdlihPitAzuuEK2s/s1600/Nitra+rek123+(1).jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCigkLfxCxt1tv2y0FkQh6OSXQPIIaxZxKZeNKYzs1B3MzCcMA5nwCOxhexjsUWpqdlA-KT3R5_jVsKFc9ChhX46pWDhJyfXq8XTbqNRTB0LGIqbgcniUozYCSHW_NdlihPitAzuuEK2s/s1600/Nitra+rek123+(1).jpg\" height=\"227\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">rez veľkomoravskou hradbou podľa AU SAV</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br /></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhIkVMamw399uW8xVcy5EbdlMA7fhfokIfg6LfUd2wBZomfHmj1J0_Ia3d0zQsQKQFAuBD7iNvsF9RtUEqrL9F9_hpDk0RHsVl7H2x_kIo1Sj2Xms-Bxpw0rGQkEYUktNKnJ6RDhfR9DsI/s1600/rytina-nitra-24.jpeg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhIkVMamw399uW8xVcy5EbdlMA7fhfokIfg6LfUd2wBZomfHmj1J0_Ia3d0zQsQKQFAuBD7iNvsF9RtUEqrL9F9_hpDk0RHsVl7H2x_kIo1Sj2Xms-Bxpw0rGQkEYUktNKnJ6RDhfR9DsI/s1600/rytina-nitra-24.jpeg\" height=\"266\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nOkrem zobrazenia samotného hradu máme snahu vytvoriť aj komplexnejší pohľad na centrum Nitry v období 9. storočia, kde by bolo zachytené opevnené podhradie a okolité hradiská, &nbsp;tak verme že aj táto kresba sa podarí.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nAutorovi patrí opäť veľká vďaka.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/feeds/5361237852816220459/comments/default","title":"Zverejniť komentáre"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2014/01/nitra-v-9-storoci.html#comment-form","title":"0 komentárov"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/5361237852816220459"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/5361237852816220459"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2014/01/nitra-v-9-storoci.html","title":"Nitra v 9. storočí"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Orgon"},"uri":{"$t":"http://www.blogger.com/profile/01396912608531297025"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"32","height":"32","src":"//blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjRf79q2mlg3o6hsyWbYMCCgv1WaA6pM0mtkWB0QdJ76W64emXoS0lwpSlUw9K5iinuoAVrX4RwIXY0RoOkY_QRl8Yy2oMkJAodsY_W7_GnMHXspVw3fuuBpiYA7JlSOlY/s220/SH+Kruh+s+dlznom1.JPG"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUBNKKGkwYYnAWsgsH88oyO3WmGcvZh4-MlICWU2Q_vw3i2ZET98ZEvgflxRMRyEjJddBnIM6F68y8vvfSl9v54IuLr_hZ8m_v7QQnjJETT3ssD5CZfKORByJljuHa7fgX7qewLE9muMk/s72-c/P1183895.JPG","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}]}}